BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 187.087 Td (9. Bind the neckline with the bias strip, right sides together and raw edges even, leaving the last 2 cm free at) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 171.213 Td (each center back edge \(the zipper goes there later\). Ease the strip gently around the curves. Trim to 6 mm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 155.339 Td (turn the folded edge to the inside and topstitch or slipstitch it down.) Tj ET
